@startuml
title Transfer restriction - standard transfer (transfer / transferFrom / batchTransfer)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

start
:transfer(to, value) / transferFrom(from, to, value) / ERC-3643 batchTransfer(tos, values)\nspender = msg.sender (transferFrom) or address(0) (transfer);
if (contract paused?) then (yes)
  :revert EnforcedPause;
  stop
else (no)
endif
if (spender / from / to frozen?) then (yes)
  :revert ERC7943CannotSend(spender or from)\nor ERC7943CannotReceive(to);
  stop
else (no)
endif
if (RuleEngine set?) then (yes)
  :RuleEngine.transferred(spender, from, to, value)\n(reverts if the transfer is not compliant);
else (no)
endif
:transfer valid -> rest of the ERC-20 flow\n(balance check, allowance if transferFrom, ...);
stop

note right
  Deactivation is not checked here: a deactivated contract is always
  paused, so the pause check already blocks the transfer.
end note
@enduml
